<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CEZ CZK H1 3.55bln net - Czech acct.</title>
<headline>Czech CEZ CZK H1 3.55bln net - Czech acct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech power utility CEZ a.s. said on Friday  that it posted 3.55 billion crowns after tax profit in the first half  of 1997, to Czech accounting standards, versus 5.10 billion in the  same period last year.</p>
</text>
